  "term": "nuclear complex",
  "definition": "A nuclear complex here refers to the olivary nuclear complex, a group of brainstem nuclei in the hindbrain also called the olivary body. It lies in parts of the medulla oblongata and pontine tegmentum and contributes to motor control while providing major sensory input to the cerebellum.",
